              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "درج کرنا (darj karnā) is built from darj, usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic darj, \"a roll, a written record\", and کرنا: to put a thing on the record. The thing written agrees: رپورٹ (riporṭ) درج کی."
